Section 1: Governance & Board Approval
The board of directors must approve all compliance frameworks annually.
\f
Section 2: Compliance Monitoring
The compliance department shall monitor regulatory updates weekly and perform review assessments.
\f
Section 3: Incident Reporting
The institution must report material incidents within 72 hours.
\f
Section 4: Records Retention
The firm must retain records for audit review for at least seven years.
\f
Section 5: Customer Disclosure
The firm must notify customers of privacy updates within 30 days.
